WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Useful writing starts before the draft: with a bounded source packet.

00:06.000 --> 00:13.000
Two independent sources record Jayson Tatum's 2023–24 regular-season line.

00:13.000 --> 00:20.000
The tempting draft turns those numbers into proof of elite two-way impact.

00:20.000 --> 00:28.000
Domain QA stops that inference. The packet has no efficiency, tracking, on-off, or impact evidence.

00:28.000 --> 00:36.000
The repair keeps the supported facts and makes the missing evidence explicit.

00:36.000 --> 00:43.000
Every final claim remains traceable. Publication still belongs to a human.
